{"id":"634b02102672cc2a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-functional-graph.md","title":"Turing 泛函的有限图","display":"df-functional-graph — Turing 泛函的有限图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-functional-graph","aliases":["20-df-functional-graph"],"display":"df-functional-graph — Turing 泛函的有限图","chapter":"3","section":"3.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.3.7；Theorem 3.3.8","source_pdf_pages":[92],"source_printed_pages":[56],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-functional-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-functional-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-functional-graph — Turing 泛函的有限图"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.3.7；Theorem 3.3.8"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；有限三元组通过固定配对编码为自然数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nG_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^2:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nG_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\omega^2:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_e\">\\(G_e\\)</span> 的编码是 c.e.。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 兼容且分别输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\">\\(y,z\\)</span>，可取它们的共同延伸并应用确定性，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=z\">\\(y=z\\)</span>。还满足有限串延伸单调性。这是部分连续泛函的有效有限见证。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.3.7；Theorem 3.3.8；印刷页 56；PDF 第 92 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functional\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\nG_e:=\\{(\\sigma,x,y)\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times\\omega^2:\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"G_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"y,z","display":false},{"tex":"y=z","display":false}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"c7d3b5746093d796","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"bc7d5064491f1d37","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-gl1]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"},{"id":"d7650db2ba55e66d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。"},{"id":"711da376393d5bc5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-lachlan-game]]；see [[20-df-functional-graph]]；see [[20-thm-graph]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"}],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1","35073b74f84433b3"]}